WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Speaker 1: With young and deeply unqualified&nbsp;
Congressman Madison Cawthorn losing his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.960
primary challenge in North Carolina. There was&nbsp;
apparently an opening in the Tarheel State for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:14.880
another 20 something year old Republican to enter&nbsp;
Congress and be in completely over their head.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.360
Insert Beau Hines, 26 years old, who is&nbsp;
running for Congress on the Republican&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:25.520
ticket to represent the 13th District of North&nbsp;
Carolina. He made headlines this week for not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:31.040
