confusing it with the retail clothing store.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:36.160
He did this while trying to make the point, by the&nbsp;
way, that it is Joe Biden who is the one who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:42.080
incompetent and incoherence. Hines was on the John&nbsp;
Fredericks radio show and the two were talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:48.560
about the FBI raid on Donald Trump and the Biden&nbsp;
administration's plan to hire more IRS agents.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:53.120
Republicans lately have loved to lump these two&nbsp;
issues together as if they have anything to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:59.200
with one another. They don't. More on that on the&nbsp;
show later. And then Beau made the case that even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:04.880
though there's all these corrupt people in the&nbsp;
highest ranks of our government, it's not fair to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.440
call the United States a banana republic, because&nbsp;
that's an insult to Banana Republic stores all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:17.280
across the country. Let's take a look at the clip.
Speaker 3: You get the Congress. Is it going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:23.920
be real? Are we actually going to be willing to&nbsp;
defund IRS, FBI and things of that nature? I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.560
we have to I mean, we're at a point in our&nbsp;
country now we have a unregulated fourth branch of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:32.480
government that's targeting middle class Americans&nbsp;
on a daily basis. I mean, it's unbelievable.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.800
A lot of people have, like in the situation that's&nbsp;
going on right now is, you know, they say we're in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:40.880
a banana republic. I think that's an insult to&nbsp;
banana republics across the country. I mean, at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:45.680
least the manager of Banana Republic, unlike our&nbsp;
president, knows where he is and why he's there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:49.600
