right now that doesn't know where he is, doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:53.520
know who he is or what time it is. And he's&nbsp;
attempting to run our country. At the same time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:58.000
this fourth unregulated branch of government,&nbsp;
which is the FBI, the DOJ, targeting Americans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.600
every single day. I mean, it's unbelievable.
Speaker 1: My absolute favorite part of that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:06.400
clip is the radio hosts reaction to it all. He has&nbsp;
this look of, oh, crap, this guy doesn't know what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:11.440
a banana republic is. Should I correct damage?&nbsp;
Should I just let it slide? What exactly do I do?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:16.240
How do I run? Cover for what's going on here? Now&nbsp;
the campaign is in damage control mode. They're&nbsp;&nbsp;

