trying to say that this was all just a joke, even&nbsp;
though there was no laugh or smile or indication&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:27.440
at all that what he was saying was in jest, Rob&nbsp;
Burgess, his senior adviser, said in response,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:32.400
It's clear now that the American people can add&nbsp;
understand a joke to the ever growing list of&nbsp;&nbsp;

